		{
			"id": "title",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# OP-TEE Boot Flow (qemu_v8 target)\nProcedural graph: left to right is chronological. File cards below each stage link to the wiki pages with full detail.",
			"x": -1816,
			"y": -606,
			"width": 2172,
			"height": 120
		},
		{
			"id": "st-qemu",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**QEMU**\n`-bios bl1.bin`\nEmulated qemu_armv8a board loads BL1 into SRAM, jumps to EL3.",
			"x": -1800,
			"y": -420,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "st-bl1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**BL1** (TF-A)\nROM-stage trust anchor. Loads + authenticates BL2.",
			"x": -1440,
			"y": -420,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "st-bl2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**BL2** (TF-A)\nLoads + authenticates BL32 and BL33. Boots BL32 first.",
			"x": -1080,
			"y": -420,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "st-bl32",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**BL32 = OP-TEE OS**\nSecure world, S-EL1.\n3 images: bl32.bin / bl32_extra1.bin / bl32_extra2.bin\nCold-boots TEE core, then idles for SMCs.",
			"x": -720,
			"y": -420,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 200,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "st-bl33",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**BL33 = U-Boot**\nNormal world. Loads Linux + rootfs.",
			"x": -340,
			"y": -420,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "st-linux",
